WEBVTT

00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:16,790
Now, often should liver levels be checked even when doing fed vendors all at least on a

00:00:16,790 --> 00:00:21,510
monthly basis, but I have some people that detoxify fed vendors all just fine.

00:00:21,510 --> 00:00:27,350
They've done it monthly and it's never raised their ALT and AST, it's never raised their

00:00:27,350 --> 00:00:31,390
liver markers, and then they don't have to necessarily do it monthly.

00:00:31,390 --> 00:00:38,230
Again, I think it splits about 50-50, 50% of the people just don't detoxify it well at

00:00:38,230 --> 00:00:41,390
all, and their liver markers start to go up.

00:00:41,390 --> 00:00:45,670
Those are the people that need to be more diligent in getting their numbers checked.

